    "title": "Biosolid spill from Tulsa truck shuts down roads in Sapulpa - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By David Prock ,\n12 hours ago First responders are working to clean up a major mess stretching from Tulsa to Sapulpa after a truck hauling biosolids leaked material for miles before stopping. Officials say a semi hauling treated wastewater, also known as biosolids, from a Tulsa plant began leaking material from its trailer as it traveled south. The spill continued for several miles and was not contained until the truck stopped in Sapulpa. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
